  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HELP TRAIN 100 RURAL WOMEN TO ADDRESS HUNGER</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will help train 100 women in hard to reach rural areas to become food and self sufficient by learning organic farming and home gardening at their backyard. This training help them send their children to school and address hunger.  Women will establish group agroforestry orchards under our #SeedlingsOnWheels initiative, we will form group farms and tree propagators in the villages and on the group farms and fruit trees&apos; gardens to address food insecurity and deforestation.</narrative>
  </description>
